    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Place a double‑layer of 5‑mm thick corrugated sheets inside the wooden crate, aligning the flutes perpendicular to the bike’s frame. Cut openings for the wheels and secure the bike’s central triangle to the sheets using zip ties.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding-top: 10px;">
